 ],
 "Site Description": "<p>Troll is around 235 km from the coast, at Jutulsessen, in Dronning Maud Land.</p><p>Troll station opened on February 1990 for summer-only operation. Opened for year-round operation on February 2005.</p><p>Year round clean air facility, geology, geodesy, glaciology and biology. Satellite ground station.</p>",
